How about this for a bug?  I came across one
of my old ghost piles who had died while carrying
the ball and chain (I did not have a ball and
chain at the time).  I looked down at the pile,
and the items in the pile went something like:

  a heavy iron ball (chained to you)
  an iron chain
  a cursed mace
  ...

I picked up what I needed (not picking up the iron 
ball and chain), and much to my surprise, I found
that the ball was now really chained to me. Bummer!

